{
  "_source_notes": {
    "source": "SRD 5.1 class Equipment sections and Equipment Packs section.",
    "structure": "packs are defined once and referenced by id from each class. Each class's equipment is a list of choice groups (the SRD's lettered a/b/c options) plus a separate list of fixed, non-choice grants. Nothing is pre-resolved to a single answer.",
    "option_shapes": [
      "{ \"weaponId\": \"...\" } \u2014 a specific weapon that exists in equipment.json",
      "{ \"armorId\": \"...\" } \u2014 a specific armor that exists in equipment.json",
      "{ \"packId\": \"...\" } \u2014 references an entry in the top-level packs object",
      "{ \"item\": \"...\" } \u2014 a specific named item with no id yet in equipment.json (see gap list below)",
      "{ \"category\": \"...\" } \u2014 a generic SRD category (\"any simple weapon\", etc.) with no single resolved answer; the SRD leaves this to the player"
    ],
    "data_gaps": [
      "Named items referenced below with no matching id in equipment.json: wooden shield (distinct from the generic shield). Add these before any code tries to resolve a menu choice into an equipped item."
    ]
  },

